WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.400
- Now, we are getting to
something real good, y'all.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.900
Regina King recently said

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.270
that this next guest
seems like Sarah Vaughan

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.940
and Ella Fitzgerald are
both living in her body.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.940
That's a beautiful musical
baby. I'm just saying.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.160
She's one of the most
compelling jazz singers

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.330
on the scene right now

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.820
and you're about to see why and hear why.

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.850
Now performing her Christmas
single, "Warm in December,"

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.880
give it up for Samara Joy.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.699
(audience cheers)
(audience applauds)

