00:01:34.446 --> 00:01:38.405
♪ A kind of oven ♪

00:01:38.405 --> 00:01:43.405
♪ To melt the sleet and snow ♪

00:01:43.654 --> 00:01:47.865
♪ This heart that glows ♪

00:01:47.865 --> 00:01:51.662
♪ Like an ember ♪

00:01:51.662 --> 00:01:56.662
♪ Longs to be loved just by you ♪

